WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.319
Have you ever wondered what SCP-887, Hypergraphia,
wants?

00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:10.930
Foundation researchers used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-887 while

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.290
it was writing in a notebook.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.580
This was the result:

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.100
"A list of names and numbers, subsequently
identified as every member of the Parliament

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:23.170
of Lithuania (current and former, beginning
at independence from the Soviet Union), and

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.339
their birth weight in grams."

